<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: CZECH JAN RETAIL SALES -2.3 PERCENT (+9.4 PCT).</title>
<headline>CZECH JAN RETAIL SALES -2.3 PERCENT (+9.4 PCT).</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Czech January retail sales, in real terms, fell 2.3 percent compared with the same month in 1996, the Czech Statistical Bureau (CSU) said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The CSU also said that total internal trade fell by 1.4 percent year-on-year in real terms in January.</p>
</text>
